---
title: "syncLegionAddresses (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_read_registry: read addressRegistry
    q_read_registry --> q_update: fetch current Legion addresses from registry
    q_update --> [*]: update legionBouncer, legionSigner, etc., emit AddressesSynced

    note right of q_read_registry
        INV-001: addresses sourced from central LegionAddressRegistry
        INV-002: stale addresses replaced with current registry values
    end note
